# Comments in English

All comments in source code must be written in **English**.

- Use English for: package comments, function/method comments, inline comments, and TODO/FIXME notes.
- Keep comments clear and concise.

```go
// Good: package-level and inline in English
// SendBulk POSTs the payload to the given URL as JSON.
if url == "" {
	return nil // no webhook configured
}

// Bad: non-English comments
// 웹훅 URL로 페이로드를 전송합니다.
return nil // 웹훅 미설정
```
